Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: describe hims,h432b-gps-power
Upstream-Status: Pending

Describe required device resources separately from board wiring, with
explicit supplies and GPIO roles for validation of the runtime device tree.

---
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/power/hims,h432b-gps-power.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
+%YAML 1.2
+---
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/power/hims,h432b-gps-power.yaml#
+$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+
+title: H432B GPS receiver supply and reset sequencer
+
+maintainers:
+  - Freya Fractal <24643711+highenergymagic@users.noreply.github.com>
+
+description: |
+  Board sequencer for the UART-connected GPS receiver. Receiver data uses
+  the separate UART. This binding does not identify a receiver silicon model.
+
+properties:
+  compatible:
+    oneOf:
+      - const: hims,h432b-gps-power
+      - const: fractal,h432b-gps-power
+        deprecated: true
+
+  vcc-supply: true
+
+  reset-gpios:
+    maxItems: 1
+    description: Active-low receiver reset.
+
+required:
+  - compatible
+  - vcc-supply
+  - reset-gpios
+
+additionalProperties: false
